  {
    "verse": 9,
    "original": "מֽוֹשִׁיבִ֨י&thinsp;<b>׀</b> עֲקֶ֬רֶת הַבַּ֗יִת אֵֽם־הַבָּנִ֥ים שְׂמֵחָ֗ה הַֽלְלוּ־יָֽהּ׃&nbsp;<span class=\"mam-spi-pe\">{פ}</span><br>",
    "transliteration": "mvoshiyviy&thinsp;<b>|</b> 'akeret havayit 'em-havaniym semehah halelv-yah.&nbsp;<span class=\"mam-spi-pe\">{f}</span><br>",
    "translation": "Assentando a solitária no lar, mãe de filhos alegres; louvai o Senhor."
